# serializer version: 1
# name: test_bug_work_mandate_names_plan_and_diagnosis
  'Bug artifact contract for my-bug: the reviewed implementation-plan is the execution spine; the diagnosis is the verified root-cause context the plan grounds on; input is the reported symptom. Write the reproduction test the diagnosis prescribes and drive it red→green.'
# ---
# name: test_prepare_selector_skips_kindless_todos_without_lifecycle_phase
  '''
  IMPORTANT: This output is an execution script. Follow it verbatim.
  
  SLUG: <none>
  
  BLOCKERS:
  - no active preparation work found
  
  NEXT ACTION:
  1. Create a new todo: `telec todo create <slug> <content> [--kind feature|change|bug|task]`.
  2. Or pick an existing slug from `telec todo list`.
  3. Then call `telec todo prepare <slug>` to drive the lifecycle.
  
  AGENT SELECTION GUIDANCE:
  
  Agent characteristics are in your baseline context (Agent Characteristics concept).
  Runtime availability:
  - CLAUDE: available
  - CODEX: available
  - GEMINI: available
  
  THINKING MODES:
  - fast: simple tasks, text editing, quick logic
  - med: standard coding, refactoring, review
  - slow: complex reasoning, architecture, planning, root cause analysis
  '''
# ---
# name: test_prepared_auto_continue_reuses_parent_prepare_worker
  '''
  PREPARED: parent is ready for work.
  
  AUTO-CONTINUE:
  Execute in order:
  telec sessions send sess-parent-worker "parent is PREPARED and frozen in your context; drive prepare for unblocked child child: telec todo prepare child"
  
  telec sessions end sess-parent-reviewer
  
  AUTO-CONTINUE dispatched dependent prepare work.
  '''
# ---
# name: test_prepared_auto_continue_spawns_fresh_when_parent_worker_is_absent
  '''
  PREPARED: parent is ready for work.
  
  AUTO-CONTINUE:
  Execute in order:
  telec sessions run --command /next-prepare --args child --project /repo
  
  telec sessions end sess-parent-reviewer
  telec sessions end self
  
  AUTO-CONTINUE dispatched dependent prepare work.
  '''
# ---
# name: test_prepared_bug_with_matching_diagnosis_upstream_does_not_redispatch_drift_analyzer
  '''
  telec sessions end self
  
  PREPARED: matching-drift-bug is ready for work.
  
  DECISION REQUIRED: Continue preparation work, or start the build/review cycle with telec todo work matching-drift-bug.
  '''
# ---
# name: test_prepared_cleanup_is_unchanged_without_unblocked_children
  '''
  telec sessions end sess-parent-reviewer
  telec sessions end self
  
  PREPARED: parent is ready for work.
  
  DECISION REQUIRED: Continue preparation work, or start the build/review cycle with telec todo work parent.
  '''
# ---
# name: test_work_entry_with_matching_diagnosis_upstream_dispatches_build_started
  'BUILD_START_DISPATCH: matching-drift-bug'
# ---
